    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Organized Capy God is a relaxing game in which you help a friendly capybara organize all his items while trying to reunite with his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/1560fdcbced3fb57ad7155b525da9b16.poster.avif?t=1754054509\" width=640 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/1560fdcbced3fb57ad7155b525da9b16.webm?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/1560fdcbced3fb57ad7155b525da9b16.mp4?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once everything is in order, Capy God will ask you for certain items to fill the world he was creating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/94fcb653e0f6f496c99d12d2557846be.poster.avif?t=1754054509\" width=640 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/94fcb653e0f6f496c99d12d2557846be.webm?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/94fcb653e0f6f496c99d12d2557846be.mp4?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry! There are no timers, meters or scores. You can take as much time as you like to group items in the way you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something strangely peaceful about sorting items, give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort, stack, group and organize!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine certain items to unlock achievements. \ud83c\udfc6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your capy with cute accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartfelt story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No way to lose, no time pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for playing after a long day of work or school to slow your brain down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intuitive drag and drop controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long dialogues or intense situations that require a lots of skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction from a well organized space :)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 items to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played in bite-size sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect to play while listening to audiobooks or watching videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill original music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Organized Capy God is a relaxing game in which you help a friendly capybara organize all his items while trying to reunite with his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/1560fdcbced3fb57ad7155b525da9b16.poster.avif?t=1754054509\" width=640 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/1560fdcbced3fb57ad7155b525da9b16.webm?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/1560fdcbced3fb57ad7155b525da9b16.mp4?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once everything is in order, Capy God will ask you for certain items to fill the world he was creating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/94fcb653e0f6f496c99d12d2557846be.poster.avif?t=1754054509\" width=640 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/94fcb653e0f6f496c99d12d2557846be.webm?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585550/extras/94fcb653e0f6f496c99d12d2557846be.mp4?t=1754054509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry! There are no timers, meters or scores. You can take as much time as you like to group items in the way you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something strangely peaceful about sorting items, give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort, stack, group and organize!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine certain items to unlock achievements. \ud83c\udfc6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your capy with cute accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartfelt story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No way to lose, no time pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for playing after a long day of work or school to slow your brain down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intuitive drag and drop controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long dialogues or intense situations that require a lots of skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction from a well organized space :)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 items to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played in bite-size sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect to play while listening to audiobooks or watching videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill original music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Help Capy God reunite with his family! Sort, organize and group items in this relaxing and chill game!",
